sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor User
participant UI as Browser (index.html)
participant WS as WebServer
participant F as SetupFacade
participant C as Catalog
participant B as PcBuild.Builder
participant R as BuildRepository
participant Bus as BuildEventBus
participant Log as ActivityLog
participant W as CompatibilityWatcher
participant PC as PriceCalculator

User->>UI: choose a part in the dropdown
UI->>WS: POST /api/builds/{id}/component
WS->>F: setComponent(buildId, componentId)
F->>C: find(componentId)
C-->>F: Component (made by ComponentFactory)
F->>B: toBuilder().part(c).build()
B-->>F: new immutable PcBuild
F->>R: save(build)
F->>Bus: publish(CHANGED)
Bus->>Log: onEvent(CHANGED)
Bus->>W: onEvent(CHANGED)
W->>W: CompatibilityChecker.check(build)
opt incompatible
  W->>Bus: publish(WARNING)
  Bus->>Log: onEvent(WARNING)
end
WS->>F: summary(buildId)
F->>PC: quote(build)
Note over PC: Decorator chain gives subtotal,<br/>Strategy gives discount
PC-->>F: Quote
F-->>WS: Summary (build, issues, quote)
WS-->>UI: JSON
UI-->>User: updated price, warnings, activity log
